OL,3,ASomalia's top court rejects president's
OL,4,Aterm extension amid political crisis
OL,5,
OL,6,FSomalia's Supreme Court has ruled that
OL,7,FPresident Hassan Sheikh Mohamud
OL,8,Funlawfully extended his term,
OL,9,Fescalating a political crisis and a
OL,10,Fstandoff between the presidency and
OL,11,Fjudiciary.
OL,13,FThursday's ruling came a day after
OL,14,FMohamud dismissed Chief Justice Bashe
OL,15,FYusuf Ahmed - a move which the court
OL,16,Fsaid the president lacked the authority
OL,17,Fto take.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
