OL,3,ASomalia's top court rejects president's
OL,4,Aterm extension amid political crisis
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe court also ordered political
OL,7,Fleaders to agree on an electoral plan
OL,8,Fwithin 30 days and hold elections
OL,9,Fwithin 90 days, potentially disrupting
OL,10,Fgovernment plans for nationwide polls
OL,11,Fnext year.
OL,13,FMohamud's four-year mandate expired in
OL,14,FMay, but his administration extended it
OL,15,Fby a year through law changes approved
OL,16,Fby parliament in March.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
